    <item>
      <title>GPT-5「解决」数学难题？OpenAI这次是“检索的王”，还是“凡尔赛”翻车？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/gpt-5openai-20251019161006051-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 19 Oct 2025 16:10:06 +0800</pubDate>
